# Publish ecosystem

## Repos (agreed names)

| Repo | Role |
|------|------|
| `ai-personal` | Full ~/ai backup minus `~/ai/.gitignore` |
| `role-based-agent-model-harness` | Public framework — MIT |

## Key paths

| Path | Notes |
|------|--------|
| `~/ai/publish-manifest.md` | Repo + visibility registry |
| `~/ai/.gitignore` | Private repo exclusions |
| `~/ai/.gitignore.public` | Public export exclusions |
| `~/ai/agents/<role>/AGENTS.md` | Read `Visibility` + `Publish exclude` |

## Visibility rules

- **private** — never in public tree
- **public** — export agent folder; still **no plans/**
- **mixed** — export minus paths in `Publish exclude`

## May read

- All of `~/ai` when user grants (for building publish plans)

## Writes

- Local `plans/` only by default
- Git operations on repos only after user confirms publish plan
- May update `publish-manifest.md` when user approves
